@title Clicking the tip of an interruption arrow wires its pin (1920x1080)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
# Test report 14: the interruption point's only pin is at the arrow tail, so a click on the tip did nothing. The whole arrow picks the pin now.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key q
text interruption
key Return
click 1000 500
wait 5
key Escape
wait 5
shot placed
click_text Corners
wait 3
click 1000 521
wait 5
shot wire-from-tip
expect "click a pin or wire to finish"
